   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam Red Cross Society Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With funding from FCDO (110,045 GBP) for CARA project, BRC commits additional resources 481849 GBP from its insured funding and 200,000 GBP aspiration fundraising over 2025-2028. For now in the partnership project page we have included only 481849 as insured and not included 200,000 GBP as they are still aspirational. In case the aspirational funding is getting secured we will revised the GAD and project page
This funding and partnership will allow BRC and VNRC to collaborate and explore additional resources for responsive programming and long-term resilience capacity development in the evolving humanitarian and climate landscape of VNRC.</narrative>
  </description>
